    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Execution ownership",
      "items": [
        "pydantic-graph controls the lifecycle; PydanticAI tool retries regenerate rejected proposals.",
        "SQL executes in DataFusion. Generated Python executes in Monty; scientific calls use an isolated worker."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Repair contract",
      "items": [
        "Feedback includes the rejected artifact, exact error, authoritative contracts and remaining budget.",
        "An input repair invalidates affected results; unrelated SQL evidence can be reused.",
        "Static checks cover supported imports and directly traceable keys; runtime and declared invariants remain necessary."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Working-tree design",
      "items": [
        "This design describes the uncommitted refactor; no pinned-commit source verification is claimed.",
